<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Mukundara Hills Tiger Reserve with eco-sensitive zones, outer boundary</name><description>Outer boundary of Mukundara Hills Tiger Reserve (as amended 5 Oct 2023) together with its 2020 eco-sensitive zone and the 2021 Bhainsrorgarh eco-sensitive zone, joined from Rajasthan Forest Department map files. Measured 1514.62 km² (WGS84). The eco-sensitive zones take in most of the 2023 villages and part of the unmapped 2023 buffer, but the 2023 buffer compartments near Kota (Akelgarh, Sakatpura), the National Chambal piece and the Bundi compartments have no public map and may fall partly outside. The 2020 ESZ was drawn around the 2013 reserve, so part of it is now reserve buffer. Reconstructed from Rajasthan Forest Department map files for reference. Not a legal or cadastral boundary: the reserve is defined by the schedules and boundary descriptions in the notifications. The Forest Department marks its files as for management use, not legal purposes. Built 2026-10-23 by mhtr.in; method and sources: https://mhtr.in/gis-maps/</description><Style id="outline"><LineStyle><color>ff1f5f2e</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>401f8a5c</color></PolyStyle></Style><Placemark><name>Mukundara Hills Tiger Reserve and eco-sensitive zones</name><description>Outer boundary of Mukundara Hills Tiger Reserve (as amended 5 Oct 2023) together with its 2020 eco-sensitive zone and the 2021 Bhainsrorgarh eco-sensitive zone, joined from Rajasthan Forest Department map files. Measured 1514.62 km² (WGS84). The eco-sensitive zones take in most of the 2023 villages and part of the unmapped 2023 buffer, but the 2023 buffer compartments near Kota (Akelgarh, Sakatpura), the National Chambal piece and the Bundi compartments have no public map and may fall partly outside. The 2020 ESZ was drawn around the 2013 reserve, so part of it is now reserve buffer. Reconstructed from Rajasthan Forest Department map files for reference. Not a legal or cadastral boundary: the reserve is defined by the schedules and boundary descriptions in the notifications. The Forest Department marks its files as for management use, not legal purposes. Built 2026-10-23 by mhtr.in; method and sources: https://mhtr.in/gis-maps/</description><styleUrl>#outline</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="layer"><value>outer-boundary-with-esz</value></Data><Data name="name"><value>Reserve and eco-sensitive zones, outer boundary</value></Data><Data name="measured_area_km2_wgs84"><value>1514.62</value></Data><Data name="reliability"><value>Official files joined. Covers the reserve outline above plus both notified eco-sensitive zones, which also take in most of the village enclaves inside Bhainsrorgarh and part of the unmapped 2023 buffer. Some 2023 additions near Kota and in Bundi may still fall outside.</value></Data><Data name="method"><value>Reserve outer boundary joined with the MHTR ESZ outer-limit file and the Bhainsrorgarh ESZ file. Holes the official files draw are kept (the 3.5 km² exclusion in the MHTR ESZ file); gaps under 0.5 km² where two files' edges miss each other are filled.</value></Data><Data name="instrument"><value>Rajasthan Forest Department notification F.3(8)Forest/2012, 9 Apr 2013; Rajasthan Forest Department notification F.3(22)Forest/2023, 5 Oct 2023; MoEFCC S.O. 4268(E), 25 Nov 2020; MoEFCC S.O. 3683(E), 10 Sep 2021</value></Data><Data name="source_files"><value>Forest Department file 'Mukundara Tiger Reserve.kmz' (Tiger Reserve boundary); listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2025-02-24; SHA-256 ec3c6d02c14a… | Forest Department file 'Mukundara Hills National Park.kmz'; listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 a23ca5b24f00… | Forest Department file 'Darrah Wildlife Sanctuary.kmz'; listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 cf25d680f872… | Forest Department file 'Jawahar Sagar Wildlife Sanctuary.kmz'; listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 ab6e078d52aa… | Forest Department file 'Bhensrodgarh Wildlife Sanctuary.kmz'; listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 b670cf408245… | Forest Department file 'MHTR.kmz' (ESZ outer limit); listed as on 01.06.2026; server copy 2026-06-01; SHA-256 fe784add4d17… | Forest Department file 'BHAINSROAD ESZ.kmz'; listed as on 01.06.2026; server copy 2026-06-01; SHA-256 6e11e297b0c1… | Forest Department file 'KOTA.kmz' (Kota district forest blocks); listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 f27d048338dc…</value></Data><Data name="source_urls"><value>https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/tigerreserve/Mukundara%20Tiger%20Reserve.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/wildlife/Mukundara%20Hills%20National%20Park.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/wildlife/Darrah%20Wildlife%20Sanctuary.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/wildlife/Jawahar%20Sagar%20Wildlife%20Sanctuary.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/wildlife/Bhensrodgarh%20Wildlife%20Sanctuary.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/ESZ/MHTR.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/ESZ/BHAINSROAD%20ESZ.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/kota/KOTA.kmz</value></Data><Data name="built"><value>2026-10-23</value></Data><Data name="disclaimer"><value>Reconstructed from Rajasthan Forest Department map files for reference. Not a legal or cadastral boundary: the reserve is defined by the schedules and boundary descriptions in the notifications. The Forest Department marks its files as for management use, not legal purposes.</value></Data><Data name="gaps"><value>The eco-sensitive zones take in most of the 2023 villages and part of the unmapped 2023 buffer, but the 2023 buffer compartments near Kota (Akelgarh, Sakatpura), the National Chambal piece and the Bundi compartments have no public map and may fall partly outside. The 2020 ESZ was drawn around the 2013 reserve, so part of it is now reserve buffer.</value></Data></ExtendedData><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>76.155717,24.818367,0 76.155820,24.817965,0 76.155837,24.817847,0 76.155068,24.817956,0 76.154190,24.818071,0 76.154426,24.817494,0 76.154484,24.817343,0 76.154826,24.817056,0 76.154834,24.817049,0 76.155264,24.816774,0 76.155277,24.816774,0 76.155403,24.816692,0 76.155519,24.816599,0 76.155505,24.816595,0 76.155460,24.816580,0 76.154949,24.816602,0 76.153882,24.816667,0 76.152710,24.816781,0 76.151853,24.816881,0 76.151919,24.817267,0 76.152068,24.818056,0 76.152089,24.818174,0 76.152210,24.818774,0 76.152179,24.818778,0 76.152008,24.818822,0 76.151551,24.818875,0 76.151118,24.818938,0 76.150275,24.819074,0 76.150059,24.819093,0 76.148947,24.818987,0 76.148024,24.818889,0 76.147048,24.818823,0 76.146923,24.819366,0 76.146758,24.820095,0 76.146755,24.820108,0 76.147371,24.820747,0 76.148032,24.820946,0 76.149000,24.821204,0 76.149278,24.821271,0 76.150273,24.821512,0 76.152046,24.821849,0 76.1